{"id":93453,"date":"2022-03-31T11:18:20","date_gmt":"2022-03-31T04:18:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/?p=93453"},"modified":"2022-03-31T11:18:20","modified_gmt":"2022-03-31T04:18:20","slug":"bupati-jember-sampaikan-lkpj-akhir-tahun-anggaran-2021","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/bupati-jember-sampaikan-lkpj-akhir-tahun-anggaran-2021\/","title":{"rendered":"Bupati Jember Sampaikan LKPJ Akhir Tahun Anggaran 2021"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-93457 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/humas.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194044_IMG_9953-scaled-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" \/><\/p>\n<p>JEMBER, Bupati Jember Ir. H. Hendy Siswanto, ST. IPU. menyampaikan nota pengantar Laporan Keterangan Pertanggungjawaban (LKPJ) akhir tahun anggaran 2021 dalam rapat paripurna yang dihadiri jajaran pimpinan dan 28 anggota dewan DPRD Jember pada Rabu malam (30\/03\/2022).<\/p>\n<p>LKPJ merupakan laporan pelaksanaan tugas atau progress report dari Bupati kepada DPRD selama satu tahun anggaran atas dasar Rencana Kerja Pemerintah Daerah (RKPD) sehingga hubungan eksekutif-legislatif tetap berjalan dengan baik.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-93453 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330193621_IMG_9941-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330193621_IMG_9941-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330193640_IMG_9944-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330193640_IMG_9944-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194157_IMG_9957-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194157_IMG_9957-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194232_IMG_9963-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194232_IMG_9963-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194302_IMG_9966-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194302_IMG_9966-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194309_IMG_9968-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194309_IMG_9968-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194536_IMG_9979-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194536_IMG_9979-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194539_IMG_9980-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194539_IMG_9980-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Bupati Jember Hendy Siswanto dalam pidatonya menyampaikan, Kabupaten Jember terus mengalami kemajuan berkat partisipasi serta kolaborasi semua pihak, kendati tidak dipungkiri masih ada permasalahan yang harus dicarikan jalan solusinya bersama-sama.<\/p>\n<p>&#8220;Pada awal masa pemerintahan kami adapun langkah-langkah yang kami lakukan pertama melaksanakan KSOTK sesuai rekomendasi KemenPAN-RB, kemudian dilanjutkan dengan penataan birokrasi,&#8221; ungkap Bupati Hendy dalam penyampaian LKPJ.<\/p>\n<p>Kedua yaitu menyusun dan menetapkan Perkada untuk operasional rutin dan wajib seperti pembayaran gaji ASN maupun Non-ASN.<\/p>\n<p>Ketiga yaitu menyusun dan menetapkan Perda APBD tahun anggaran 2021.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-93453 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194739_IMG_9981-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194739_IMG_9981-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194855_IMG_9984-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194855_IMG_9984-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194953_IMG_9987-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194953_IMG_9987-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330195708_IMG_0001-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330195708_IMG_0001-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330200020_IMG_0009-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330200020_IMG_0009-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330200059_IMG_0011-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330200059_IMG_0011-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>&#8220;Selanjutnya perkenankan kami menyampaikan LKPJ tentang pengelolaan keuangan daerah, yang pertama pendapatan daerah tahun anggaran 2021 dimana dari target sebesar Rp. 3.681 triliun lebih, dapat direalisasikan sebesar Rp. 3.563 triliun lebih atau tercapai sebesar 96,8 persen,&#8221; urainya. (ipf)<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>JEMBER, Bupati Jember Ir. H. Hendy Siswanto, ST. IPU. menyampaikan nota pengantar Laporan Keterangan Pertanggungjawaban (LKPJ) akhir tahun anggaran 2021 dalam rapat paripurna yang dihadiri jajaran pimpinan dan 28 anggota dewan DPRD Jember pada Rabu malam (30\/03\/2022). LKPJ merupakan laporan pelaksanaan tugas atau progress report dari Bupati kepada DPRD selama satu tahun anggaran atas dasar &hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":93457,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[3],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-93453","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-berita-terbaru"],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/20220330194044_IMG_9953-scaled-1.jpg","_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/93453","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"h